# Root build context ignore file (used by infra/discovery/runtime.Dockerfile, build context = repository root).
# Deny everything, then allow only what the runtime build needs.
# legacy/ is built with its own context (./legacy) and is not affected by this file.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!.npmrc
!tsconfig.base.json
!tsconfig.json
!packages/
!packages/**
# Never include, even under packages/:
packages/**/node_modules
packages/**/dist
**/.env
**/*.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.git